### 5. Comparison: thos Types vs. Official SDK Types

| Aspect | thos (`/Users/chiu.fyi/work/personal/thos/lib/types.ts`) | Official SDK (`sdk.d.ts`) |
|--------|------|------------|
| **Assistant message** | `ClaudeAssistant.message.content` is a custom `AssistantContentBlock[]` | Uses `BetaMessage` from `@anthropic-ai/sdk` (includes `usage`, `model`, `stop_reason`, thinking blocks, etc.) |
| **Result subtypes** | Only `"success"` and `"error"` | `"success"`, `"error_during_execution"`, `"error_max_turns"`, `"error_max_budget_usd"`, `"error_max_structured_output_retries"` |
